          <!-- EN auto-closes an <a> that wraps a <table> (measured 2026-08-18,
               probe 0Mgmjr - the row anchor arrived EMPTY and nothing was
               clickable), so the row link is per-cell anchors sharing ONE URL
               field via data-link-group: same group + byte-identical hrefs =
               one replacement spliced into every member, nothing to desync.
               The copy anchor authors a concrete #000000 (renders
               identically to the old inherit) so the color mints a palette
